        <mxCell id="arch_summary" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13.5px;&quot;&gt;Top-Level Modular SoC Architecture (rtl/rdm6300_picorv32_soc.v)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Cấu trúc mô-đun chuẩn hóa: rtl/core/ (CPU, 1KB SRAM, Flash XIP spimemio, Interconnect, GPIO) | rtl/uart/ (Dual Unified UART MMIO với FIFO 32B: u_rfid_uart &amp;amp; u_host_uart)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
